  "title": "Утро после клуба  (The Morning After the Club)",
  "level": "A1 — Duolingo Section 2",
  "labels": {
    "max": "Макс",
    "vika": "Вика"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On the morning after a lively night at the club. Max is quietly trying to leave the apartment, but Vika wakes up and catches him at the door. As always, listen to the whole conversation in Russian first, and then we will break it down together in English.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Мне уже идти надо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Ты что, убегаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Почему убегаю? Нет, просто ухожу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Вот так? И всё?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "А то, что между нами было?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Спасибо. Прикольно было.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Прикольно, и всё?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А что ещё?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Да ладно тебе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Нет, денег у меня нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Мы с тобой так не договаривались.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Мне не нужны твои деньги.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Тогда я пошёл. У меня дела.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Уходи. И не возвращайся сюда.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's go through their awkward morning exchange step by step. Max is eager to leave, but Vika has questions.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Мне уже идти надо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I need to go now.' Max attempts to slip out quietly in the morning, keeping his exit brief.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Ты что, убегаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What, are you running away?' Vika catches him at the door and confronts him about sneaking out.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Почему убегаю?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why running away?' He plays dumb, pretending this is just a normal departure.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Нет, просто ухожу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, I'm just leaving.' Max stammers out a weak denial to defend his hasty exit.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Вот так? И всё?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just like that? And that's all?' She is shocked by his casual attitude after their intimate night together.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "А то, что между нами было?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What about what was between us?' Vika demands to know if their connection meant anything to him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Спасибо. Прикольно было.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you. It was fun.' He brushes it off as a casual hookup, completely misreading her emotional investment.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Прикольно, и всё?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Fun, and that's it?' She repeats his careless word, offended by his dismissive tone.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А что ещё?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What else?' Max coldly implies there was nothing more to their encounter.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Да ладно тебе.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, come on.' Vika scoffs at his callousness, unable to believe his behavior.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Нет, денег у меня нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, I have no money.' He tries to excuse himself by claiming he cannot offer her financial compensation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Мы с тобой так не договаривались.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You and I didn't agree to that.' Max points out that they made no promises to each other.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Мне не нужны твои деньги.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't need your money.' She snaps back that she doesn't want a payout, deeply insulted by the suggestion.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Тогда я пошёл.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I am off.' He takes her rejection of money as an opportunity to finally leave.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Уходи. И не возвращайся сюда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Leave. And do not come back here.' Vika kicks him out in anger, commanding him never to return. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
